# m57_won: game_state gets 10h (a human has won) and loses 2 (the battle goes on) when
# the first pass begins, so that the loop is left and picture D0h follows without a round
# played (battle_score does nothing in round 0).  Not the game's own doing: a poke, for
# the pictures behind the loop on the port's own clock.  The byte was C3h there in m57_menu.
game_state D1
